Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:24:40 -0700
Subject: [Backport] CVE-2026-113097: Use after free in FileSystem (1/2)

Cherry-pick of patch originally reviewed on
https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8411405:
Refactor read permission checks into `CheckReadAccess()`

To prepare for restricting File System Access handle usage in 3P
contexts, this CL consolidates duplicated read permission checks across
leaf handle method into `FileSystemAccessHandleBase::CheckReadAccess()`.

This CL should introduce no behavioral changes.

Bug: 526039697
Change-Id: I81e1300466577adf73be27d93cd693863ad3ef94
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8411405
Reviewed-by: Mingyu Lei <leimy@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Ming-Ying Chung <mych@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1699571}
Reviewed-on: https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtwebengine-chromium/+/783207
Reviewed-by: Moss Heim <moss.heim@qt.io>
